CRITICAL: Never use conditional assertions that can silently pass:
- WRONG: if len(data) > 0: item = data[0]; assert 'id' in item
- RIGHT: assert len(data) > 0, "Expected non-empty response"; item = data[0]; assert 'id' in item, "Missing id"
- Every assert statement must execute unconditionally — no if/else guards around assertions

